228 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Sometimes the value of AI is\240not\240in answering the question \024 it\031s in reframing it\056\n\nSecond\055lens\240mode injects\240strategic imagination\054 surfacing what\031s not being asked\054 but maybe should be\056\nSolution mode\240respects the executive\031s framing\054 and focuses on\240executional velocity\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240frame disruption and frame precision\056\n\050The former is better when the user is still exploring what to even want\056 The latter is sharper when they already know where they want to go\054 they just need the terrain mapped\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 229 0 R
     /Pg 222 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
